WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.700
I think we don't have a culture
that would get good cops.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.800
What about our culture do you think
would produce responsible

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.600
powerful people?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.000
Are we trying to do that?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:14.900
Was that our goal?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.100
Was that what we were doing this whole time?

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.820
I didn't get the memo.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:20.600
I thought we were

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.200
doing adderall

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.840
and trying to

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.180
fuck a lot of bitches

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.300
and put our fingers into holes.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.900
And uh... just trying to do a lot of things.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.300
Y'know it's an extreme culture.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.540
We're not going to produce wizened policemen.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.800
What did you expect.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.300
We're stupid

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.920
We get stupid people.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.800
We produce a lot of stupid people.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.800
And some of them are going to be cops.

